  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5e0c62854ba04e2469dfb7ea4953b1a9, type: 3}
  m_Name: S5Cevap2009
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  etiket: dogc
  aciklama:
  - "2009 y\u0131l\u0131 m\u0131? Eyvah eyvah!\r\nDomuz gribi ya da Kuzey Amerika
    Gribi olarak da bilinen H1N1, mikroskop alt\u0131nda ilk o y\u0131l g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFClenmi\u015Fti.
    Demek sen yoktun..."
  - "2009 y\u0131l\u0131 demek...\r\nD\xFCnyaca \xFCnl\xFC yazar Dan Brown'\u0131n
    Kay\u0131p Sembol isimli kitab\u0131n\u0131n o y\u0131l \xE7\u0131kt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    biliyor muydun? Her hal\xFCkarda art\u0131k biliyorsun..."
  - "2009 \xF6yle mi? Vav!\r\n\u0130svi\xE7re - Fransa s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131nda kurulan
    ve evrenin en temel s\u0131rlar\u0131n\u0131 ortaya \xE7\u0131karmay\u0131 hedefleyen
    Avrupa N\xFCkleer Ara\u015Ft\u0131rmalar Merkezi'nin (CERN) o y\u0131l faaliyete
    ge\xE7ti\u011Fini biliyor muydun?"
  - "2009 ha?\r\nJames Cameron'\u0131n ola\u011Fan\xFCst\xFC filmi Avatar'\u0131n
    o y\u0131l g\xF6sterime girdi\u011Fini biliyor muydun? \u0130\u015Fte bunlar
    hep bilgi..."
  - "Demek 2009? Ah ahh...\r\nPop m\xFCzi\u011Fin kral\u0131 Michael Jackson, hayata
    o y\u0131l g\xF6zlerini yummu\u015Ftu. \u0130dol\xFCmd\xFC. Sayg\u0131yla an\u0131yorum."
